my maintenance) and custom action delays. Includes live Country/Money Overviews, Captured Land metrics, and an Auto Move camera tracking module (teleport, tween, or walk).\n\n\n\nEngine Tab: Safety reserve thresholds (cash percentage/millions, manpower), strategic risk/priority policies, and an Auto War manager with 10 condition gates (Positive Daily Net, Reserve Protection, Strength Ratios, Maximum War Caps, Ally Avoidance). Includes campaign rules (Consolidate Territory, Recover Losses, Stage Before Declaration) and target diagnostic panels.\n\nECONOMY & INFRASTRUCTURE\n\n\n\n\n\nDefense Tab: Auto Defense (Fortify Cities) automates defensive upgrades, unit garrisons, threat radar alerts for incoming war justifications, and defensive threat overviews.\n\n\n\nDevelopment Tab: Auto Develop handles tier upgrades based on city priority, revenue forecasts, and automated consolidation (garrisoning and developing newly captured land).\n\n\n\nResearch Tab: Auto Research features a tree-driven order/plan editor with per-slot priority overrides pulling live tech-tree data directly from the game's Technology module.\n\nMILITARY AUTOMATION\n\n\n\n\n\nAuto Army Tab: Builds armies using doctrine-adaptive unit compositions, upkeep budget caps, and city priority spawning. Features auto-grouping with custom names and icons, individual division controls, and loss-tracking rebuild ledgers.\n\n\n\nAuto Capture Tab: Automates city captures via Spread or Focused distribution. Features wartime safety checks, corridor avoidance, native AutoCapture ownership management, and managed-group filters.\n\n\n\nAuto Deploy Tab: Handles front-line defensive deployments, Auto Air (plane movement/bombing), Carrier Logistics (aircraft staging), Auto Missiles (targeted strikes), custom movement routes, and force limits.\n\nDIPLOMACY, WAR, & PEACE\n\n\n\n\n\nAlliances & Diplomacy Tabs: Manual and automated diplomacy tools including bilateral alliances, protected resource transfers, Auto Accept/Send Allies, alliance creation, bank deposits/withdrawals, puppet management, and target country intelligence.\n\n\n\nWar & Peace Tab: Manages active wars with peace requests, peace term builders, and Auto Annex (BARRAGE Terms vs Native Auto Peace settlement modes, Demand Puppet Status). Features automated incoming Request Handling (peace, war, alliance) backed by safety verification.\n\nVISUALS, TELEPORT, & UTILITIES\n\n\n\n\n\nESP & Visuals Tab: Army, City, and Player ESP with side/country filters, In-Game Relation Map overlays, player activity intelligence, and adaptive performance refresh controls.\n\n\n\nQuick Teleport Tab: Scoped CFrame teleports to Any City (All/Owned/Controlled/Capital), Country Shortcuts (Capital, Highest Population), War Fronts (Threatened Core, Enemy Capital), and Army Divisions with full navigation history.\n\n\n\nOptimizations & Utility Tabs: Quick Performance Setup profiles, rendering optimization, FPS limiting, Auto Claim Battle Pass/Progression/Formable Nation rewards, Auto Transform, session diagnostics, and emergency Force Stop automation switches.\n\n\n\nWebhooks Tab: Granular Discord webhook alerts with per-event","tags":["Auto War","Auto Farm","Auto Win","Instant Win","Auto Army"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://barrage.cc/ControlEurope\"))()","owner":{"_id":"69afb8801526fb78b442675a","username":"fetish","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d47ff166db27a45567447736b71b023e7cefb81480124d825bac604090562c4d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69afb8801526fb78b442675a-1791972389836.png"},"lvl":10,"status":"offline","id":"69afb8801526fb78b442675a","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"month","rank":5,"period":"month","metric":"likes","value":54}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d47ff166db27a45567447736b71b023e7cefb81480124d825bac604090562c4d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69afb8801526fb78b442675a-179197238